'Shallow water over a tabulated bottom reflection coefficient'
500.0				! FREQ (Hz)
1				! NMEDIA
'CVW'				! SSPOPT: C-linear, vacuum surface, dB/wavelength
0 0.0 100.0			! NMESH, SIGMA, DEPTH of bottom (m)
0.0 1536.418 /
100.0 1536.418 /
'F' 0.0				! Bottom: reflection coefficient from .brc
1				! NSD
50.0 /				! SD(1:NSD) (m)
101				! NRD
0.0 100.0 /			! RD(1:NRD) (m)
501				! NR
0.0 2.0 /			! R(1:NR) (km)
'CB'				! Run type: coherent, Gaussian beams
0				! NBEAMS (automatic)
-80.0 80.0 /			! ALPHA1,2 (degrees)
0.0 101.0 2.1			! STEP (m), ZBOX (m), RBOX (km)
